'''Pokémon Pocket Comics: XY''' (Japanese: '''ポケモンＸ・Ｙ爆笑４コマまんが全集''' ''Pokémon X & Y Laughter 4Koma Comic Compilation'') is a [[Pokémon 4Koma]] {{pkmn|manga}} created by 春風邪三太 [[Santa Harukaze]] with cooperation from [[Shogakukan|ShoPro]] and design by {{jwp|佐々木多利爾}} Sasaki Tariji. It is 240 pages long.

